34
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:27,000
Nous avançons notre prière

35
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:33,000
L'éternel entend les cris du cœur

36
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Il voit l'humiliation et les fleurs

37
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:43,000
